cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the archive and the associated article."
title: "Fluoride-baseline: detectors, sampling plans and controls for the Fluc/CrcB fluoride channel census across archaeal genomes"
abstract: >-
  Three calibrated equivalog profile HMMs (Fluc/CrcB, CLC-F, FAcD), their
  calibration records, phylogenetically balanced sampling plans over GTDB r226,
  census tables, and a self-testing control suite supporting the manuscript on
  the detection of the Fluc/CrcB fluoride channel across 1,259 archaeal genomes.
